{"product_id":"buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-vc60","title":"Buture VC60 Cordless Vacuum | 450W 38KPA","description":"\u003cp\u003eIs there any better feeling than coming home to a spotless house after a long day? Probably not, but the frustration of lugging around a heavy vacuum can quickly dampen that joy. With the right lightweight vacuum cleaner, however, keeping your home clean becomes a breeze. Imagine effortlessly gliding from room to room, picking up every bit of dirt and debris with ease, without the strain on your arms or back. If you're in the market for the best lightweight vacuum that combines power and convenience, the Buture VC60 is the perfect choice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture VC60 is the lightest cordless vacuum in Buture's lineup, weighing just 5.95 lbs. This lightweight design is perfect for effortlessly maneuvering around your home, whether you’re cleaning tight spaces, stairs, or high surfaces.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePowerful Performance in a Lightweight Package\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith three power modes—Eco, Middle, and Max—the VC60 delivers strong cleaning performance across a variety of surfaces. The motorized brush effectively lifts dirt and hair from carpets and upholstery, while the crevice tool is perfect for reaching into hard-to-access areas. The vacuum transitions smoothly from rugs to hardwood floors, ensuring no dirt or debris is left behind.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eNo Smell? Freshen Your Home as You Clean \u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhile powerful suction is a must for any lightweight vacuum, it often doesn't eliminate the lingering odors from dirt, dust, pet hair, and food debris. But there's good news for BuTure VC60 users. Our latest innovation, the scented card, tackles this issue head-on. Recent feedback from BuTure VC60 owners shows that 90% noticed a significant reduction in odors after using the scented card.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur scented card is free of alcohol and additives, perfect for homes with babies, pets, and sensitive individuals. Vacuum with the BuTure VC60 cordless vacuum cleaner and enjoy a refreshing fruity scent that enhances your well-being.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eDesigned for Ease of Use\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VC60 is built with the user in mind, prioritizing simplicity and ease of use. Its innovative double-handle design provides superior control and reduces strain, making it easy to maneuver even during extended cleaning sessions. The power and setting buttons are conveniently located for easy access, and the extendable pole adapts to various heights at the push of a button, making it ideal for users of all sizes. Switching between attachments is effortless, allowing you to transition smoothly between different cleaning tasks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eVersatile Attachments for Any Job\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VC60 is equipped with a variety of attachments to handle a range of cleaning tasks. The extendable pole can be adjusted to the perfect height, allowing you to clean everything from low-lying areas to high ceilings without strain. The vacuum attachment, motorized brush, and crevice tool provide the flexibility to clean different surfaces and reach tight spaces easily. Each attachment locks securely into place, ensuring a stable and effective cleaning experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eStorage and Charging Made Simple\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VC60 comes with a wall mount for convenient storage. The battery and attachments can be securely hung on the wall mount, keeping everything organized and easily accessible. Its compact design means it can fit seamlessly into any storage space, making it a great choice for homes with limited space. Plus, the quick 4-5 hour recharge time means your vacuum is always ready for action.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eProduct Details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .vc60-table {\n        width: 96.4943%;\n        height: 582px;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n    .vc60-table th, .vc60-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n    }\n    .vc60-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .vc60-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"vc60-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSpecification\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSuction Power\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e450W\/38Kpa\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAutomatic Adjustment\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eNo\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eRuntime\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUp to 55 minutes\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e5.95 lbs\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDust Bin Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e0.4 gal\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e4-5 hours\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDouble-Handle\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTouch Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCrevice Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTwo-in-one Brush\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eHair Cleaning Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Pack\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eHEPA Filter\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSponge Filter\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAroma Tablet\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ex1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45492869234943,"sku":"VC60","price":149.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/Buture_VC60_Vacuum_Cleaner.jpg?v=1769151288","url":"https:\/\/ibuture.com\/products\/buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-vc60","provider":"Buture Official","version":"1.0","type":"link"}